WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.190 --> 00:00:04.190
This is Berk, son.

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:08.299
It was the home of your grandparents and their grandparents before them.

00:00:08.940 --> 00:00:14.570
But out there, beyond the age of the world, lies the home of the Dragons.

00:00:17.730 --> 00:00:22.520
And I believe it's your destiny to one day...

00:00:22.520 --> 00:00:24.400
find this hidden world.

00:00:28.440 --> 00:00:31.320
You do know my leg isn't a chew toy don't you?

00:00:31.320 --> 00:00:32.640
Is this what you want?

00:00:32.640 --> 00:00:33.640
Go get it!

00:00:35.760 --> 00:00:37.920
Uh, how am I supposed to get down?

00:00:41.060 --> 00:00:42.780
Hey bud, wait up!

00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:50.320
He's not the only one.

00:00:56.380 --> 00:00:58.380
Another Night Fury.

00:00:59.620 --> 00:01:01.780
It's more like a Bright--

00:01:01.780 --> 00:01:03.560
A Light Fury.

00:01:03.560 --> 00:01:05.460
Yeah, yours is better, probably.

00:01:11.590 --> 00:01:15.360
There is an armada, with enough cages for all of our dragons!

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:20.160
This is a new kind of enemy.

00:01:21.580 --> 00:01:23.100
We need to find the hidden world.

00:01:23.100 --> 00:01:25.660
I will destroy everything you love.

00:01:25.660 --> 00:01:27.140
Toothless! NO!!

00:01:29.240 --> 00:01:31.660
Your nothing without your dragon.

00:01:33.800 --> 00:01:37.400
If Grimmel succeeds, there won't be any dragons left,

00:01:37.400 --> 00:01:39.550
and it's up to us to put an end to it!

00:01:40.130 --> 00:01:42.380
So what are you gonna do about it?

00:01:42.380 --> 00:01:43.180
Suit up gang!

00:01:46.380 --> 00:01:47.960
We have one shot at this!

00:01:48.760 --> 00:01:50.560
You brought a baby to a battle?

00:01:50.560 --> 00:01:51.420
I couldn't find his sitter!

00:02:02.110 --> 00:02:04.780
The Hidden World... It really does exist.

00:02:05.660 --> 00:02:06.740
Now that's a King.

00:02:08.140 --> 00:02:09.600
Your right, bud. It's time.

00:02:14.720 --> 00:02:16.320
Well, look who it is!

00:02:22.080 --> 00:02:23.580
Not a word.

